# Local overrides for `wrangler dev`. Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored).
#
# Nothing is required: there are no secrets. D1 and the email binding are wired
# in wrangler.jsonc, and the two vars below default to the values there.
# Uncomment to override locally.
#
# CONTACT_FROM=contact@sumit.codes
# CONTACT_TO=sumit.codes.24@gmail.com   # must stay equal to the binding's destination_address
